The model
---------
Nanbeige4.3-33B, by the Nanbeige team. https://huggingface.co/Nanbeige/Nanbeige4.3-33B
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (LICENSE).

Changed by CanadaApollo6:
  model-*.safetensors   the weights, quantized to EXL3 3.5 bits per weight (exllamav3 1.6.5) on Nanbeige's own text
  draft/                a DFlash2 draft head, trained by CanadaApollo6 on Nanbeige4.3-33B's outputs
The tokenizer and config files are Nanbeige's, with the quantization settings added to config.json.
README.md is this build's card, not Nanbeige's.

